   -p "{\"spec\": {\"requestRollout\": \"<lastCompletedRolloutRequest-value>\"}}"
 ```
 
+{{< note >}}
+
+You do not need to revert `environmentdImageRef` when cancelling a rollout. The
+Operator tracks the image of the last completed rollout (recorded in
+`status.lastCompletedRolloutEnvironmentdImageRef`) for the balancerd and console
+resources, so they stay aligned with the environmentd version that is actually
+running. If no rollout has completed yet, the Operator falls back to
+`spec.environmentdImageRef`.
+
+{{< /note >}}
+
